Package: camera-studio
Version: 1.0.6-3
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Kumar-Jy <https://github.com/Kumar-Jy>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Provides: pro-camera, cam-studio
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-pil, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gstreamer1.0-tools, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-plugins-ugly, libcamera-tools, v4l-utils, iio-sensor-proxy, hicolor-icon-theme
Description: Camera Studio for Xiaomi Pad 5 (nabu)
 GTK4 / Libadwaita camera application featuring real-time tablet orientation
 tracking, VCM autofocus control (tap-to-focus, slider, presets), manual
 exposure and gain adjustment, color presets, photo & video recording, and
 built-in photo gallery.
